msgid "Archived: Updating the APM2.x BootLoader"
msgstr "已归档：更新 APM2.x 引导加载程序"

#: ../../source/docs/updating-the-apm2-x-bootloade.rst:7
#: ae8fbbd316d94134bbe39e2b903286cb
msgid ""
"The Atmel 2560 boot loader should not have to replaced, however sometimes "
"developers or users or a brownout etc., will corrupt the boot loader or the "
"fuse bits. This renders the Mission Planner and other firmware uploads "
"unsuccessful."
msgstr ""
"Atmel 2560 引导加载程序通常无需更换，但有时开发者、用户操作或欠压等情况会损坏引导加载程序或熔丝位，导致 Mission Planner "
"及其他固件上传失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/updating-the-apm2-x-bootloade.rst:12
#: 941e08f70c884f9fa005ed16daebf19c
msgid ""
"You will need an AVI ISP Programmer to flash the boot loader and set the "
"fuses correctly."
msgstr "您需要一台 AVR ISP 编程器来烧录引导加载程序并正确设置熔丝位。"

#: ../../source/docs/updating-the-apm2-x-bootloade.rst:15
#: 969ab8fd1cc34708bd014750ae6b1653
msgid ""
"The 2560 Boot loader HEX file is located in the APM source downloads for "
"Arudcopter, Plane, Rover in the folder. ::"
msgstr "2560 引导加载程序的 HEX 文件位于 ArduCopter、Plane、Rover 的 APM 源码下载目录中的如下文件夹内："

